values ('generated-grammar-en-a2-6c8c9e6d2dc6-exercise-05', 'en', 'A2', 'Identifique o erro na frase', 'Encontre a frase que tem um erro no uso de advérbio de frequência ou modo.', 'Incorrect: ''He runs fastly.'' Correct: ''He runs fast.''', 'Qual frase está incorreta?', '["She always arrives early.","He speaks English well.","They work hardly every day.","I sometimes feel tired."]'::jsonb, 2, 5, true, 'generated-grammar-en-a2-6c8c9e6d2dc6')
